{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim island on which you will manage a  team of exiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is included in this demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">basic mechanics like exploration, fighting, crafting, trading and camping</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a short map prepared specifically for the demo - enough to show you the basics of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a few types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">quite a lot of items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">two team skills and one skill for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a few dialogues and monologues</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is not included in this demo, but will be available in the full version?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">full storyline and quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">selection of 9 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">an open world map divided into biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more types of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more characters skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a lot of dialogues and monologues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">new mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control over exiles and manage their physical and mental well-being. Craft, buy, or find equipment by exploring to help you survive until the light of a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781640/extras/exploration.gif?t=1750084414\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make full use of the unique mechanics of the new health and psyche system based on grid. Discover different weapons with their unique attacks. Choose from four different attack types: firearm, melee, throwable and placeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781640/extras/combat.gif?t=1750084414\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on quests, trade with wandering merchants, master new skills and listen to your characters stories, thoughts and fears - and at day's end, set up camp to rest and prepare for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781640/extras/dialogues.gif?t=1750084414\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique turn-based combat system built upon grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fight against Affects - physical manifestations of emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">explore different places on island to uncover ancient secrets and find treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">discover each character's personality and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">collect ingredients and craft various items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">listen to what your charactes have to say</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781640?t=1750084414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781640/7c5640b598aa5b3269294e684eb8f16114469569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750084414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781640/2aad651d9c161156557c78eaae73ead1646097e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750084414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor